{"id":"573895","name":"萝卜包子","author":"香香的小厨房","authorId":"10121381","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/573895/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"肉末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青萝卜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"生抽","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱姜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"适量"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"萝卜切丝加盐，腌制一会。","img":"images/573895/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"腌好后挤掉水分切碎。","img":"images/573895/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"葱姜切碎。","img":"images/573895/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"倒入开水泡好，晾凉备用。","img":"images/573895/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"肉末中加盐、白糖、生抽、老抽、蚝油、鸡精。","img":"images/573895/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"顺一个方向搅拌。","img":"images/573895/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"泡好的葱姜水分三次倒入搅拌上筋。","img":"images/573895/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入葱花。","img":"images/573895/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"浇热油。","img":"images/573895/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再次搅拌均匀。","img":"images/573895/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放入萝卜丝。","img":"images/573895/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搅匀备用。","img":"images/573895/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"面包机中放500克面粉、3克酵母、5克白糖。","img":"images/573895/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"倒入260克温水。","img":"images/573895/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"开始和面。","img":"images/573895/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"发酵至两倍大。","img":"images/573895/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"取出面团排气，揉成光滑的面团。","img":"images/573895/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"搓成长条切成小剂子，再将小剂子揉几下。","img":"images/573895/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"擀成四周溥中间厚的包子皮。","img":"images/573895/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"包入适量的包子馅。","img":"images/573895/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"包好收口。","img":"images/573895/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"包子包好后放入蒸屉、二次发酵醒发至体积明显变大。","img":"images/573895/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"冷水上锅蒸，水开后蒸15分钟，焖两分钟。","img":"images/573895/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}